Server init.

>> x := Blob mpya: 65 aina: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Programu mpangilio: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server kiungo: (
 Orodha mpya ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Orodha mpya ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x kutoka: 0 urefu: 1), mstari-mpya.
x achilia.

